Package: ACTA
Type: Package
Title: Anybody Can Titrate Antibody - Automated Flow Cytometry Reagent Titration
Version: 3.0.8
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jatin", "Sharma", email = "jatin1995@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lyell Immunopharma, Inc.", role = "cph"))
Description: An R workflow for analysing flow cytometry reagent titration
    experiments. A run reads a flowset of FCS files plus one Excel instructions
    workbook, gates positive and negative populations with openCyto, and reports
    a Stain Index per stain quantity together with a Michaelis-Menten fit, a PDF
    report, and an HTML dashboard across runs. "Reagent" covers antibodies and
    non-antibody stains alike, including fluorophore-conjugated streptavidin,
    viability dyes and peptide-MHC multimers.
License: AGPL-3
